# ─── Site URL ───
# Used as the absolute base for canonical links, Open Graph/Twitter URLs, the
# sitemap and robots.txt. No trailing slash.
#
# Falls back to the placeholder in src/data/site.ts if unset, which is fine
# locally but wrong in production — social previews would point nowhere.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com

# ─── Vegapunk chatbot ───
# Vegapunk answers portfolio questions from src/data/ and will also just chat
# about anything else.
#
# The key is read server-side in src/app/api/chat/route.ts and is never exposed
# to the browser. Do NOT use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefixed variable here: those are
# inlined into the client bundle and are readable by any visitor.
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-flash-lite-latest.
#
# Model choice matters on the free tier. gemini-flash-latest returns 503 "high
# demand" regularly; the lite tier has been consistently reliable. Pinned names
# like gemini-2.5-flash have been retired by Google and now return 404.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest
